 - Experience with AI tools such as ChatGPT, Cursor, Cody, or AWS Q, including prompt engineering. 
 - Proficiency in SQL development, stored procedures, and database performance optimization. &nbsp; 
 - Excellent debugging, analytical, and problem-solving skills. 
